    "caption": "🔥 <b>Phrasal verb of the day: PUT OFF</b>\n\n📖 <b>Meaning:</b> to delay doing something until later; postpone\n🇺🇿 <b>Tarjima:</b> keyinga qoldirmoq, kechiktirmoq\n\n✍️ <b>Examples:</b>\n1️⃣ I keep <b>putting off</b> my IELTS essay practice. 😅\n<i>IELTS esse mashqimni doim keyinga qoldiryapman.</i>\n2️⃣ The meeting has been <b>put off</b> until Friday.\n<i>Uchrashuv jumagacha qoldirildi.</i>\n3️⃣ Don’t <b>put</b> it <b>off</b> — start today! 💪\n<i>Uni keyinga qoldirma — bugun boshla!</i>\n\n💡 <b>Tip:</b> fe'l <b>-ing</b> bilan keladi: <i>put off doing</i> ✅ (<s>put off to do</s> ❌). Olmosh esa o'rtada turadi: <i>put it off</i> ✅ (<s>put off it</s> ❌).\n🎯 Speaking'da sinonim sifatida ishlating: <i>postpone, delay</i>.\n\n#PhrasalVerbs #EnglishTips #IELTS #RegistanAcademy\n\n📌 <a href=\"https://registan.edutizim.uz/order/entry/?survey=s33\">https://registan.edutizim.uz/order/entry/?survey=s33</a>\n\n📞 +998935512700\n\n📱 <a href=\"https://t.me/Registan_LC\">Follow us on social media</a>:\n\n📱<a href=\"https://t.me/RegistanLC_Academy\">Telegram</a>   📱<a href=\"https://instagram.com/registanlc_academy\">Instagram</a>   📱<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/ziHA5ukgVtbGmwwR6\">Location</a>",
