    "caption": "🔥 Phrasal verb of the day: PUT OFF\n\n📖 Meaning: to delay doing something until later; postpone\n🇺🇿 Tarjima: keyinga qoldirmoq, kechiktirmoq\n\n✍️ Examples:\n1️⃣ I keep putting off my IELTS essay practice. 😅\nIELTS esse mashqimni doim keyinga qoldiryapman.\n2️⃣ The meeting has been put off until Friday.\nUchrashuv jumagacha qoldirildi.\n3️⃣ Don’t put it off — start today! 💪\nUni keyinga qoldirma — bugun boshla!\n\n💡 Tip: fe'l -ing bilan keladi: put off doing ✅ (put off to do ❌). Olmosh esa o'rtada turadi: put it off ✅ (put off it ❌).\n🎯 Speaking'da sinonim sifatida ishlating: postpone, delay.\n\n#PhrasalVerbs #EnglishTips #IELTS #RegistanAcademy\n\n📌 https://registan.edutizim.uz/order/entry/?survey=s33\n\n📞 +998935512700\n\n📱 Follow us on social media:\n\n📱Telegram   📱Instagram   📱Location",
